      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `73fa6f5b89b3aaf11a89ae79a0a9e1e0bf1fad94bc38411d12b7bbea2051e041--criminal-courts-2023-24-cube-2-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2023\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 6 of 6\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | ef542c0948dd22a5fe46ea8070fb69ef43e1566234121c17595ff4764a6f8832 | missing |\n| \"Table 7\" | f7a6f43ff924e39d296d65d3880a142f5f791254584ab1a485d9988caba0d8c1 | missing |\n| \"Table 8\" | 2eca276c13642880a40941afe30db5e6bc85aded043ec98d8d932d133007c186 | missing |\n| \"Table 9\" | e4757644f4706a8e6efbf9f8c3f35d24ceaa23bf14f009bd396b3c5af510c3a8 | missing |\n| \"Table 10\" | c02f075cff4a1369b4dc9a123be5494fd6620e9afbaa740d7bbfa3069981cefa | missing |\n| \"Table 11\" | 65e1a0c3122c5d6b8eda245138fe2d24660cf14c673806cf09706229201a622a | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- A normalized copy of this workbook exists (b4b6a79b420d846d87dfd030bc0edd70f845d17d2c33d7353f5161b17cdbd289). Layout should match.\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
